WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:01.463
- Welcome back, y'all.
(audience clapping)

00:00:01.463 --> 00:00:04.549
We are celebrating Christmas
with Taraji P. Henson.

00:00:04.549 --> 00:00:07.317
Give it up!
(audience cheering)

00:00:07.317 --> 00:00:08.910
You can see her in "The Color Purple"

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:10.920
starting Christmas Day in theaters.

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:13.680
Speaking of Christmas Day,
Taraji and I both love it.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.170
So some might say a little
too much, but who cares?

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:17.003
- [Taraji] Who cares?

00:00:17.003 --> 00:00:17.836
- We don't care what you think.

00:00:17.836 --> 00:00:18.959
- No.
(audience laughing)

00:00:18.959 --> 00:00:19.792
- We love Christmas and
you will not take it.

00:00:19.792 --> 00:00:20.640
(audience laughs)

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:22.920
So we thought Taraji would
be the perfect person

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:24.570
to play our annual Christmas game.

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:28.883
Here's this year's round of
the Christmostest Hostess.

00:00:28.883 --> 00:00:32.550
♪ The Christmostest Hostess ♪

00:00:33.692 --> 00:00:35.132
(audience clapping)

00:00:35.132 --> 00:00:36.780
It's really hard to say,
if I'm being honest.

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:38.640
Here to host is a good friend of the show.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:41.400
You can see him on "That
Clip Show: Holiday Edition"

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:42.600
tonight on NBC.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.523
Everybody give it up for
our friend Matt Iseman!

00:00:47.315 --> 00:00:51.181
(upbeat music)
(audience cheering)

00:00:51.181 --> 00:00:54.264
(inaudible dialogue)

00:00:55.595 --> 00:00:56.671
- Good to see you again.

00:00:56.671 --> 00:00:58.321
- Good to see you!

00:00:58.321 --> 00:00:59.852
- Is this your first time
being on our New York set?

00:00:59.852 --> 00:01:01.207
- First time in New York.

00:01:01.207 --> 00:01:02.712
- Yes. Well, thank you.

00:01:02.712 --> 00:01:03.545
- I love being here.

00:01:03.545 --> 00:01:05.790
What better Christmas spirit gift than

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:07.530
to be here with Kelly and Taraji.

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:08.606
- Oh. Absolutely.

00:01:08.606 --> 00:01:10.113
I agree. I agree.
- Yes.

00:01:10.971 --> 00:01:12.630
- So tell us about the game. We are ready.

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:16.056
- All right, so this is how
Christmostest hostess works.

00:01:16.056 --> 00:01:16.889
- Okay.

00:01:16.889 --> 00:01:17.722
- I'm gonna ask you a series

00:01:17.722 --> 00:01:18.555
of questions about Christmas,

00:01:18.555 --> 00:01:19.388
- Okay.

00:01:19.388 --> 00:01:21.210
- Christmas parties, and Christmas decor.

00:01:21.210 --> 00:01:23.430
If you get the question
right, you get a point,

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:26.310
but if you get it wrong,
you have to take a shot of

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:29.172
that delicious but filling
eggnog in front of you.

00:01:29.172 --> 00:01:30.005
- [Taraji] Okay.

00:01:30.005 --> 00:01:30.838
- Okay.

00:01:30.838 --> 00:01:31.800
- [Matt] Now steals are allowed.

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:32.633
- Yes.
- [Taraji] Oh.

00:01:32.633 --> 00:01:33.466
- But if you get it wrong in a steal,

00:01:33.466 --> 00:01:34.620
you still do a shot.

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:35.453
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:01:35.453 --> 00:01:36.510
- The winner will get a gift

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:38.745
for her side of the audience.

00:01:38.745 --> 00:01:41.578
(audience cheers)

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:43.680
They always love that part

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:46.740
and will have her name inscribed

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:49.860
on the Christmostest Hostess
ornament that will live on

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:51.000
at the Kelly Clarkson Show

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.939
for many Christmases to come.
(audience cheers)

00:01:54.939 --> 00:01:56.123
- Alright

00:01:56.123 --> 00:01:56.956
- Ladies.

00:01:56.956 --> 00:01:57.789
- Alright.

00:01:57.789 --> 00:01:59.430
- The stakes have never been higher.

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:01.142
Buzz in when you think
you know the answer.

00:02:01.142 --> 00:02:01.975
- Okay.

00:02:01.975 --> 00:02:03.347
- [Matt] Are you ready
for Christmostest Hostess?

00:02:03.347 --> 00:02:04.180
(audience cheers)

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:05.940
- [Taraji] Okay.
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:07.350
- Here we go.

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:08.763
- First question.

00:02:08.763 --> 00:02:09.750
- Okay.

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:11.789
- What? Kissy kissy Christmas decoration

00:02:11.789 --> 00:02:12.622
(buzzer rings)

00:02:12.622 --> 00:02:13.455
- Mistletoe!

00:02:13.455 --> 00:02:14.288
- [Kelly] Oh my God.
(bell dings)

00:02:14.288 --> 00:02:15.121
Oh my God.

00:02:15.121 --> 00:02:17.988
(audience cheers)

00:02:17.988 --> 00:02:21.366
- We're gonna win, baby! We're gonna win!

00:02:21.366 --> 00:02:22.740
(Taraji laughs)

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:25.620
- That was very fast.
- [Taraji] Kissy. Kissy.

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:27.210
- I need more caffeine.

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:28.620
- I'm not a betting man.

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:30.900
- I didn't know if he was
going song or mistletoe.

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:31.733
I didn't know.

00:02:31.733 --> 00:02:32.937
- I just took a chance.

00:02:32.937 --> 00:02:34.020
Not gonna wait for it.
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.073
I'm gonna lose.

00:02:35.995 --> 00:02:37.233
- Visions of losing dance in her head.

00:02:37.233 --> 00:02:38.250
- Yup. Yup.
(Taraji laughs)

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:39.840
- Question two.

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:42.631
What decorative shell
splitter is also the name

00:02:42.631 --> 00:02:43.464
(buzzer rings)
- Elf.

00:02:43.464 --> 00:02:45.363
Where's my elf? Hiding elf.

00:02:45.363 --> 00:02:46.196
(buzzer sound)
- That is incorrect.

00:02:46.196 --> 00:02:47.029
- Elfie.

00:02:47.029 --> 00:02:49.793
(audience laughs)

00:02:49.793 --> 00:02:51.603
- Taraji, take a shot.

00:02:52.444 --> 00:02:55.277
(audience cheers)

00:02:58.620 --> 00:03:00.383
- [Kelly] You don't have
to take the whole thing.

00:03:02.438 --> 00:03:04.260
Okay. Okay. Okay.

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:05.580
- [Taraji] I'm gonna get some more wrong.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:09.900
- Alright, Kelly, you have a
chance to steal down one point.

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:12.000
What decorative shell
splitter is also the name

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.226
of a Christmas ballet.

00:03:14.226 --> 00:03:15.059
(buzzer rings)
- Nutcracker!

00:03:15.059 --> 00:03:17.568
- Nutcracker! No. No. I get it! I get it!

00:03:17.568 --> 00:03:19.589
Nutcracker. I get it.

00:03:19.589 --> 00:03:21.222
- Taraji, you already got this one wrong.

00:03:21.222 --> 00:03:22.410
- Oh.

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:23.430
- This is for Kelly.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:25.890
Kelly. Do you know the answer?

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:26.845
- Nutcracker.

00:03:26.845 --> 00:03:27.678
- Yes.
(bell dings)

00:03:27.678 --> 00:03:30.503
(audience cheers)

00:03:30.503 --> 00:03:33.336
(audience cheers)

00:03:36.344 --> 00:03:37.177
- Oh my God.

00:03:37.177 --> 00:03:40.020
- Question three. What are two other names

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:40.980
for Santa Claus?

00:03:40.980 --> 00:03:41.813
- Oh!
(buzzer rings)

00:03:41.813 --> 00:03:42.646
- [Matt] Kelly.

00:03:42.646 --> 00:03:43.479
- Saint Nick.
- [Matt] Yes.

00:03:43.479 --> 00:03:44.312
- And

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:46.399
Kris Kringle.

00:03:46.399 --> 00:03:47.232
(bell dings)

00:03:47.232 --> 00:03:48.065
- Yes!
(audience cheers)

00:03:48.065 --> 00:03:49.565
- That is correct!

00:03:49.565 --> 00:03:53.398
(audience continues cheering)

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:59.550
- For those keeping score at home.

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:01.560
Taraji did not get the question wrong,

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:03.500
but she still did a shot.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:04.530
(audience laughs)
- Oh!

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:07.440
- It's two to one, and
Taraji has three shots

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:08.273
of eggnog here, everybody.
(audience laughs)

00:04:08.273 --> 00:04:09.488
- [Kelly] She just likes eggnog.

00:04:09.488 --> 00:04:10.500
- [Matt] Here we go.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.210
Question number four.

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:13.877
- [Kelly] My stomach
(sleigh bells ringing)

00:04:13.877 --> 00:04:14.758
would be a mess.

00:04:14.758 --> 00:04:15.720
- I believe I heard the jingle bells,

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:16.553
which means

00:04:16.553 --> 00:04:17.386
- We're finished?

00:04:17.386 --> 00:04:19.412
- there is one question left.

00:04:19.412 --> 00:04:21.270
- And, and this one wins everything.

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:23.278
- Well, Taraji.
- What?

00:04:23.278 --> 00:04:25.536
- This could be worth six points.

00:04:25.536 --> 00:04:28.410
(crowd cheers)

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:29.640
Six points at stake.

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:32.370
The title of Christmostest
Hostess on the line.

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:33.450
Last question.

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:34.530
- Okay.

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:36.300
- On the third day of Christmas,

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:37.409
what did my two love-

00:04:37.409 --> 00:04:38.260
(buzzer rings)
Kelly.

00:04:38.260 --> 00:04:39.532
- [Taraji] Ah. It won't even-

00:04:39.532 --> 00:04:41.010
(Kelly hums)

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:42.876
- Three golden hens? No.

00:04:42.876 --> 00:04:43.866
- [Matt] Incorrect!
(buzzer sound)

00:04:43.866 --> 00:04:44.699
- No, no, no.

00:04:44.699 --> 00:04:45.532
- Taraji!

00:04:45.532 --> 00:04:48.930
You must get this correct.

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:51.555
To win the Christmostest Hostess title.

00:04:51.555 --> 00:04:53.100
(Kelly mumbles song)

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:53.933
- Oh. It's-

00:04:53.933 --> 00:04:55.395
- [Taraji] Nah!

00:04:55.395 --> 00:04:56.510
(audience giggling)

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:57.360
(Matt imitates Italian accent)
- We need an answer

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:58.193
at this momente.

00:04:58.193 --> 00:04:59.310
- What is it?

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:00.859
- French hens.

00:05:00.859 --> 00:05:01.710
- French hens!

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:03.400
(bell dings)
- Three French hens!

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:04.966
(crowd cheers)

00:05:04.966 --> 00:05:07.607
Taraji. You are the champion!

00:05:07.607 --> 00:05:09.565
- [Kelly] I knew it was a bird.

00:05:09.565 --> 00:05:10.607
- Kelly.

00:05:10.607 --> 00:05:12.524
- I knew it was a bird.

00:05:13.446 --> 00:05:14.279
- Because I could...
- Are you gonna take one?

00:05:14.279 --> 00:05:15.112
- I'll take one with you.

00:05:15.112 --> 00:05:17.713
- [Taraji] I'll take one with you.

00:05:17.713 --> 00:05:19.046
- Salud!

00:05:19.046 --> 00:05:20.572
- Salud!

00:05:20.572 --> 00:05:25.137
(audience continues cheering)

00:05:25.137 --> 00:05:26.209
- So good.

00:05:26.209 --> 00:05:30.042
(audience continues cheering)

00:05:34.168 --> 00:05:35.580
- You know how I know it's real.

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:38.790
I mean because it tastes
amazing. That is so good.

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:40.062
- It's so good.

00:05:40.062 --> 00:05:40.908
- I hope it doesn't hit me later. Okay.

00:05:40.908 --> 00:05:41.760
(Taraji laughs)

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:42.593
- It is so good though.

00:05:42.593 --> 00:05:44.460
Of course, we are all winners around here.

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:47.880
Iconic Australian footwear
brand Frankie4 is changing

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.050
the lives of everyday women,

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:51.630
especially those that are
on their feet all day long.

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:54.120
Their game changing
sneakers, flats, heels,

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.760
and boots have podiatrist design support,

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:59.640
which has earned them over
100,000 five-star reviews

00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:01.110
and a global following.

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:03.953
And you're all going home with
a $300 Frankie4 gift card!

00:06:04.845 --> 00:06:07.518
(audience cheers)

00:06:07.518 --> 00:06:09.731
Thank you for hosting.
Welcome to our New York show.

00:06:09.731 --> 00:06:11.074
- Oh. Thank you. You're the best.

00:06:11.074 --> 00:06:13.033
- Everybody, be sure
to watch it all tonight

00:06:13.033 --> 00:06:15.226
"That Clip Show: Holiday Edition" on NBC,

00:06:15.226 --> 00:06:17.880
and Taraji's movie "The Color Purple".

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:19.800
Go see it in theaters
starting Christmas Day.

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:22.750
